      <p source="#source-558-947"><seg source="#source-558-609">彼吉田の千両を以て、家を御求の御論</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-621-678"><seg source="#source-609-621">おもしろ</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-651-663">（面白）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-678-840">そふなれども、是必、前門の虎は退ぞけしに後門の狼の入り来り候咄しならんか。はたして大兄ニも御見付ハ無キ事と奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-840-852">レ</note><seg source="#source-852-873">察候。草々、奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-873-885">レ</note><seg source="#source-885-888">対</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-888-900">二</note><seg source="#source-900-906">早々</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-906-924">ニ</note><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-924-936">一</note><seg source="#source-936-947">頓首。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-947-1000" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p source="#source-968-1000"><seg source="#source-968-977">十六日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-977-1000" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-995-1000">楳</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1000-1036" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p source="#source-1021-1036"><seg source="#source-1021-1036">陸奥大先生</seg></p>
